  "name": "Question 6",
  "problem": "Let $C=AB.$ What is the value of ${c}_{21}$, if\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $A$ by the $1$st column in $B$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{21} & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =5\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =5-3 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
